@startuml checkout
' Checkout across services, with every common sequence construct
title Checkout flow (release **2026-03-01**)
header Payments team
footer Page %page% of %lastpage%

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber 10 5 "<b>[000]"

actor Customer as C
participant "Web App" as Web <<SPA>> #LightBlue
box "Backend" #F5F5F5
  participant "Order API" as API order 20
  database "Orders DB" as DB
  queue Events
end box
collections Workers

C -> Web ++ : Click **Pay**
Web ->> API : POST /orders\n(total: 42.50)
activate API #Gold
API -> DB : insert order 2026-03-01
DB --> API : id = 1042
API -[#green,bold]> Events : order.created
API --> Web -- : 201 Created
Web --> C -- : Show //receipt//

== Fulfilment ==

alt #LightGreen stock available
  Events ->o Workers : reserve items
  Workers -\ API : reserved
else #Pink out of stock
  Workers ->x API : reservation failed
  loop 3 times
    API -> API : retry with back-off
  end
else timeout
  ... 5 minutes later ...
  API <-> Events : reconcile
end

opt gift wrap
  Web -> API : add wrapping
end

par notify
  API ->> C : e-mail
else
  API ->> C : push message
end

group Audit [nightly]
  API -> DB : archive
end

[-> API : external webhook
API ->] : callback
|||
note over API, DB #LightYellow
  Orders are **immutable** once //paid//.
  * retries are idempotent
  * see [[https://example.com/runbook the runbook]]
end note
hnote over Workers : idle
rnote right of C : <color:red>refunds</color> take 3-5 days
ref over Web, API : Authentication, see login diagram
note left of C
  it's "quoted" -> not an arrow
end note
create participant Receipt
API -> Receipt ** : create
destroy Receipt
return done
newpage Second page
C -> Web : Log out
@enduml
